d = domain('MSL', 'Local Search Operations', 'Sales & Marketing', 'Prepare accurate local business information, location content, and review-response workflows without assuming platform eligibility or ranking outcomes.', 'business location, service area, customer access, verified business facts, and profile ownership', 'the relevant local-listing platform official business-profile policies and verified business records', 'Separate factual business identity from marketing wording; preserve differences between locations; verify current platform eligibility before recommending a profile or feature.')
